---
description: Preserve existing and previously generated project or deployment artifacts unless the user explicitly requests removal.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Preserve Existing Artifacts

- Do not delete files, directories, generated deployment artifacts, or existing code as automatic cleanup.
- Do not add cleanup logic that removes artifacts from earlier runs just because the current implementation no longer needs them.
- If an artifact needs to be replaced, update it in place when appropriate and leave unrelated or obsolete artifacts untouched.
- Remove an artifact only when the user explicitly asks for its removal.
